{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f8e7d6c5-b4a3-2918-7654-3210fedcba98",
    "name": "Atur Perjalanan API",
    "description": "REST API collection for Atur Perjalanan backend (NestJS).\n\n**Milestone coverage:** M3 — Health, Auth, Users | M4 — Trips & Invitations\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection and `atur-perjalanan-local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Atur Perjalanan — Local** environment\n3. Set `google_id_token` in the environment (from Google Sign-In on mobile/web)\n4. Run **Auth → Google Sign-In** — test script saves `access_token` automatically\n5. For new users, run **Complete Registration** before other authenticated requests\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `base_url` | API base URL (default `http://localhost:8080/v1`) |\n| `google_id_token` | Google OAuth ID token for `POST /auth/google` |\n| `access_token` | App JWT (auto-saved after sign-in) |\n| `realtime_token` | Supabase-compatible JWT for Realtime |\n| `username` | Username for profile/trips requests |\n| `trip_id` | Trip ID for detail/invitation/member endpoints |\n| `invitation_id` | Invitation ID for respond/cancel endpoints |\n| `member_id` | User ID of trip member to remove |\n| `document_id` | Document ID for setting cover |\n\n## Error format\n```json\n{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\", \"message\": \"...\" }, \"requestId\": \"...\" }\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
